=================================

Scope: this file documents ONLY the sixth task resolved from
"Claude To fix 1..txt" — item 10, HIGH: Current pricing code does not
match the latest intended pricing specification. Items 5 through 9 were
already completed and documented separately ("claude fixes Sept 1"
